// Note to translators:
// If a sentence is the same in your language then please change it to "#same"
//
// eg:
// LANG_ENGLISH  "HALT"
// LANG_GERMAN   "#same"
//
// (This is so we can tell which strings have been signed-off as ok to be the same words for QA
//  and because we do not store duplicate strings, which will then get exported again next time
//  as being untranslated.)
//
VERSION             "1"
CONFIG              "C:\trees\cod2\bin\StringEd.cfg"
FILENOTES           ""

REFERENCE           NEVER_IN_THE_FIELD_OF
LANG_ENGLISH        ""Never in the field of human conflict was so much owed by so many to so few." - Winston Churchill"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Jamás en el terreno del conflicto humano tantos debieron tanto a tan pocos". - Winston Churchill"

REFERENCE           SUCCESS_IS_NOT_FINAL
LANG_ENGLISH        ""Success is not final, failure is not fatal: it is the courage to continue that counts." - Winston Churchill"
LANG_SPANISH         ""El éxito no es definitivo, el fracaso no es fatídico: lo que cuenta es el valor para continuar". - Winston Churchill"

REFERENCE           IN_WAR_THERE_IS_NO_PRIZE
LANG_ENGLISH        ""In war there is no prize for the runner-up." - General Omar Bradley"
LANG_SPANISH         ""En la guerra no hay premio para el finalista". - General Omar Bradley"

REFERENCE           THERE_NEVER_WAS_A_GOOD_WAR
LANG_ENGLISH        ""There never was a good war or a bad peace." - Benjamin Franklin"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Jamás ha habido una buena guerra o una mala paz". - Benjamin Franklin"

REFERENCE           IT_IS_FATAL_TO_ENTER
LANG_ENGLISH        ""It is fatal to enter any war without the will to win it." - General Douglas MacArthur"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Es fatal emprender cualquier guerra sin la voluntad de ganarla". - General Douglas MacArthur"

REFERENCE           IN_WAR_YOU_WIN_OR_LOSE
LANG_ENGLISH        ""In war, you win or lose, live or die-and the difference is just an eyelash." - General Douglas MacArthur"
LANG_SPANISH         ""En la guerra, ganas o pierdes, vives o mueres, y la diferencia es solo de una pestaña". - General Douglas MacArthur"

REFERENCE           UNTUTORED_COURAGE_IS
LANG_ENGLISH        ""Untutored courage is useless in the face of educated bullets." - General George S. Patton"
LANG_SPANISH         ""El valor no instruido es inútil frente a balas educadas". - General George S. Patton"

REFERENCE           MAY_GOD_HAVE_MERCY_UPON
LANG_ENGLISH        ""May God have mercy upon my enemies, because I won't." - General George S. Patton"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Que Dios se apiade de mis enemigos, porque yo no lo haré". - General George S. Patton"

REFERENCE           SO_LONG_AS_THERE_ARE
LANG_ENGLISH        ""So long as there are men there will be wars." - Albert Einstein"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Mientras siga existiendo el hombre seguirán existiendo las guerras". - Albert Einstein"

REFERENCE           IN_MODERN_WAR_YOU_WILL
LANG_ENGLISH        ""In modern war... you will die like a dog for no good reason." - Ernest Hemingway"
LANG_SPANISH         ""En la guerra moderna... mueres como un perro sin motivo alguno". - Ernest Hemingway"

REFERENCE           THEREFORE_WHOEVER_WISHES
LANG_ENGLISH        ""Therefore, whoever wishes for peace, let him prepare for war." - Vegetius"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Si quieres la paz, prepárate para la guerra". - Flavio Vegecio"

REFERENCE           THE_REAL_WAR_WILL_NEVER
LANG_ENGLISH        ""The real war will never get in the books." - Walt Whitman"
LANG_SPANISH         ""La auténtica guerra jamás llega a los libros". - Walt Whitman"

REFERENCE           THERES_NO_HONORABLE_WAY
LANG_ENGLISH        ""There is nothing good in war. Except its ending." - Abraham Lincoln"
LANG_SPANISH         ""No hay nada bueno en la guerra, salvo su fin".-Abraham Lincoln"

REFERENCE           THE_DEATH_OF_ONE_MAN
LANG_ENGLISH        ""The death of one man is a tragedy. The death of millions is a statistic." - Joseph Stalin"
LANG_SPANISH         ""La muerte de un hombre es una tragedia. La muerte de millones es una estadística". - Joseph Stalin"

REFERENCE           DEATH_SOLVES_ALL_PROBLEMS
LANG_ENGLISH        ""Death solves all problems - no man, no problem." - Joseph Stalin"
LANG_SPANISH         ""La muerte resuelve todos los problemas, sin hombre, no hay problema". - Joseph Stalin"

REFERENCE           IN_THE_SOVIET_ARMY_IT
LANG_ENGLISH        ""In the Soviet army it takes more courage to retreat than advance." - Joseph Stalin"
LANG_SPANISH         ""En el ejército soviético hace falta más valor para retirarse que para avanzar". - Joseph Stalin"

REFERENCE           THE_OBJECT_OF_WAR_IS
LANG_ENGLISH        ""The object of war is not to die for your country but to make the other bastard die for his." - General George S. Patton"
LANG_SPANISH         ""El objeto de la guerra no es morir por tu país, sino hacer que otro cabronazo muera por el suyo". - General George S. Patton"

REFERENCE           IT_IS_FOOLISH_AND_WRONG
LANG_ENGLISH        ""It is foolish and wrong to mourn the men who died. Rather we should thank God that such men lived." - General George S. Patton"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Es una tontería y un error llorar a los hombres que han muerto. En su lugar, deberíamos agradecer a Dios que esos hombres hayan vivido". - General George S. Patton"

REFERENCE           NEVER_THINK_THAT_WAR
LANG_ENGLISH        ""Never think that war, no matter how necessary, nor how justified, is not a crime." - Ernest Hemingway"
LANG_SPANISH         ""No penséis nunca que la guerra, independientemente de lo necesaria que sea o justificada que esté, no es un crimen". - Ernest Hemingway"

REFERENCE           WAR_IS_FEAR_CLOAKED_IN
LANG_ENGLISH        ""War is fear cloaked in courage." - Gen. William C. Westmoreland"
LANG_SPANISH         ""La guerra es miedo enmascarado de valor". - General William C. Westmoreland"

REFERENCE           ALL_WARS_ARE_CIVIL_WARS
LANG_ENGLISH        ""All wars are civil wars, because all men are brothers." - Francois Fenelon"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Todas las guerras son guerras civiles, porque todos los hombres son iguales". - François Fenelón"

REFERENCE           I_HAVE_NEVER_ADVOCATED
LANG_ENGLISH        ""I have never advocated war except as a means of peace." - Ulysses S. Grant"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Nunca he abogado por la guerra, excepto como medio para la paz". - Ulysses S. Grant"

REFERENCE           OLDER_MEN_DECLARE_WAR
LANG_ENGLISH        ""Older men declare war. But it is the youth that must fight and die." - Herbert Hoover"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Son hombres mayores los que declaran las guerras, pero son los jóvenes las que han de librarlas y morir en ellas". - Herbert Hoover"

REFERENCE           ONLY_THE_DEAD_HAVE_SEEN
LANG_ENGLISH        ""Only the dead have seen the end of the war." - Plato"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Solo los muertos ven el fin de la guerra". - Platón"

REFERENCE           WAR_DOES_NOT_DETERMINE
LANG_ENGLISH        ""War does not determine who is right - only who is left." - Bertrand Russell"
LANG_SPANISH         ""La guerra no determina quien tiene razón, solo quien queda". - Bertrand Russell"

REFERENCE           DEATH_IS_NOTHING_BUT
LANG_ENGLISH        ""Death is nothing, but to live defeated and inglorious is to die daily." - Napoleon Bonaparte"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Morir no es nada, pero vivir derrotado y sin gloria es morir cada día". - Napoleón Bonaparte"

REFERENCE           PATRIOTS_ALWAYS_TALK
LANG_ENGLISH        ""Patriots always talk of dying for their country and never of killing for their country." - Bertrand Russell"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Los patriotas siempre hablan de morir por su país, pero nunca de matar por su país". - Bertrand Russell"

REFERENCE           ALL_THAT_IS_NECESSARY
LANG_ENGLISH        ""All that is necessary for evil to succeed is for good men to do nothing." - Edmund Burke, British statesman and philosopher"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Todo lo que la maldad necesita para triunfar es que los hombres buenos no hagan nada". - Edmund Burke, filósofo y estadista británico"

REFERENCE           IT_IS_WELL_THAT_WAR_IS
LANG_ENGLISH        ""It is well that war is so terrible, or we should get too fond of it." - Robert E. Lee"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Es bueno que la guerra sea algo tan temible, o podría acabar gustándonos". - Robert E. Lee"

REFERENCE           A_SOLDIER_WILL_FIGHT
LANG_ENGLISH        ""A soldier will fight long and hard for a bit of colored ribbon." - Napoleon Bonaparte"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Un soldado estará dispuesto a luchar mucho y duramente por un trozo de tela de colores". - Napoleón Bonaparte"

REFERENCE           HE_WHO_FEARS_BEING_CONQUERED
LANG_ENGLISH        ""He who fears being conquered is sure of defeat." - Napoleon Bonaparte"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Aquel que teme ser conquistado tiene la derrota asegurada". - Napoleón Bonaparte"

REFERENCE           YOU_MUST_NOT_FIGHT_TOO
LANG_ENGLISH        ""You must not fight too often with one enemy, or you will teach him all your art of war." - Napoleon Bonaparte"
LANG_SPANISH         ""No se debe luchar con demasiada frecuencia con un mismo enemigo o le acabarás enseñando todo lo que sabes del arte de la guerra". - Napoleón Bonaparte"

REFERENCE           THE_REAL_AND_LASTING
LANG_ENGLISH        ""The real and lasting victories are those of peace, and not of war." - Ralph Waldo Emerson"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Las victorias auténticas y duraderas son las de la paz, no las de la guerra". - Ralph Waldo Emerson"

REFERENCE           IF_WE_DONT_END_WAR_WAR
LANG_ENGLISH        ""If we don't end war, war will end us." - H. G. Wells"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Si no terminamos con la guerra, la guerra terminará con nosotros". - H. G. Wells"

REFERENCE           FROM_MY_ROTTING_BODY
LANG_ENGLISH        ""From my rotting body, flowers shall grow and I am in them and that is eternity." - Edvard Munch"
LANG_SPANISH         ""De mi cuerpo descompuesto crecerán las flores, y yo estaré en ellas. Eso es eternidad". - Edvard Munch"

REFERENCE           HE_WHO_DID_WELL_IN_WAR
LANG_ENGLISH        ""He who did well in war just earns the right to begin doing well in peace." - Robert Browning"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Aquel al que le va bien en la guerra se gana el derecho de empezar a que le vaya bien en la paz". - Robert Browning"

REFERENCE           MORE_THAN_AN_END_TO_WAR
LANG_ENGLISH        ""More than an end to war, we want an end to the beginnings of all wars." - Franklin D. Roosevelt"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Más que el fin de la guerra, queremos poner fin a los comienzos de todas las guerras". - Franklin D. Roosevelt"

REFERENCE           THERE_IS_NOTHING_SO_LIKELY
LANG_ENGLISH        ""There is nothing so likely to produce peace as to be well prepared to meet the enemy." - George Washington"
LANG_SPANISH         ""No hay nada más probable de producir la paz como estar bien preparado para hacer frente al enemigo". - George Washington"

REFERENCE           NEVER_YIELD_TO_FORCE
LANG_ENGLISH        ""Never yield to force; never yield to the apparently overwhelming might of the enemy." - Winston Churchill"
LANG_SPANISH         ""No hay que ceder nunca a la fuerza; no hay que ceder nunca a la fuerza aparentemente imbatible del enemigo". - Winston Churchill"

REFERENCE           WAR_IS_DELIGHTFUL_TO
LANG_ENGLISH        ""War is delightful to those who have not experienced it." - Erasmus"
LANG_SPANISH         ""La guerra solo es deliciosa para aquellos que no la han experimentado". - Erasmo"

REFERENCE           WAR_IS_AS_MUCH_A_PUNISHMENT
LANG_ENGLISH        ""War is as much a punishment to the punisher as it is to the sufferer." - Thomas Jefferson"
LANG_SPANISH         ""La guerra es un castigo tanto para el que la infringe como para el que la sufre". - Thomas Jefferson"

REFERENCE           WAR_WOULD_END_IF_THE
LANG_ENGLISH        ""War would end if the dead could return." - Stanley Baldwin"
LANG_SPANISH         ""La guerra se terminaría si los muertos pudieran regresar". - Stanley Baldwin"

REFERENCE           YOU_CANT_SAY_CIV
LANG_ENGLISH        ""You can't say civilization don't advance - for in every war, they kill you in a new way." - Will Rogers"
LANG_SPANISH         ""No puede decirse que la civilización no progresa, pues en cada guerra se encuentran nuevas formas de matar".  - Will Rogers"

REFERENCE           IN_PEACE_THE_SONS_BURY
LANG_ENGLISH        ""In peace the sons bury their fathers, but in war the fathers bury their sons." - Croesus"
LANG_SPANISH         ""En la paz los hijos entierran a sus padres, pero en la guerra los padres entierran a sus hijos". - Heródoto"

REFERENCE           WE_MAKE_WAR_THAT_WE_MAY
LANG_ENGLISH        ""We make war that we may live in peace." - Aristotle"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Hacemos la guerra para poder vivir en paz". - Aristóteles"

REFERENCE           THE_QUICKEST_WAY_OF_ENDING
LANG_ENGLISH        ""The quickest way of ending a war is to lose it." - George Orwell"
LANG_SPANISH         ""La forma más rápida de terminar una guerra es perderla".  - George Orwell"

REFERENCE           THE_ONLY_WINNER_IN_THE
LANG_ENGLISH        ""The only winner in the War of 1812 was Tchaikovsky." - Solomon Short"
LANG_SPANISH         ""El único ganador de la guerra de 1812 fue Tchaikovsky". - Solomon Short"

REFERENCE           IF_YOU_ARE_GOING_THROUGH
LANG_ENGLISH        ""If you are going through hell...keep going." - Winston Churchill"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Si estás pasando por un infierno... sigue adelante". - Winston Churchill"

REFERENCE           IN_PEACE_AS_A_WISE_MAN
LANG_ENGLISH        ""In peace, as a wise man, he should make suitable preparation for war." - Horace"
LANG_SPANISH         ""En la paz el hombre sabio debe hacer los preparativos apropiados para la guerra". - Horacio"

REFERENCE           WAR_IS_CRUEL_AND_YOU
LANG_ENGLISH        ""War is cruel and you cannot refine it." - William Tecumseh Sherman"
LANG_SPANISH         ""La guerra es cruel y no se puede pulir". - William Tecumseh Sherman"

REFERENCE           IN_WAR_THERE_ARE_NO_UNWOUNDED
LANG_ENGLISH        ""In war, there are no unwounded soldiers." - Jose Narosky"
LANG_SPANISH         ""En la guerra, ningún soldado sale ileso". - José Narosky"

REFERENCE           THE_ESSENCE_OF_WAR_IS
LANG_ENGLISH        ""The essence of war is violence. Moderation in war is imbecility." - John Arbuthnot Fisher"
LANG_SPANISH         ""La esencia de la guerra es la violencia. La moderación en la guerra es una imbecilidad". - John Arbuthnot Fisher"

REFERENCE           SOLDIERS_USUALLY_WIN
LANG_ENGLISH        ""Soldiers usually win the battles and generals get the credit for them." - Napoleon Bonaparte"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Las batallas las suelen ganar los soldados, mientras los generales se adjudican el mérito por ellas". - Napoleón Bonaparte"

REFERENCE           I_DONT_KNOW_WHETHER_WAR
LANG_ENGLISH        ""I don't know whether war is an interlude during peace, or peace is an interlude during war." - Georges Clemenceau"
LANG_SPANISH         ""No sé si la guerra es un entreacto durante la paz, o la paz un entreacto durante la guerra". - Georges Clemenceau"

REFERENCE           NO_ONE_CAN_GUARANTEE
LANG_ENGLISH        ""No one can guarantee success in war, but only deserve it." - Winston Churchill"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Nadie puede garantizar el éxito en la guerra, tan solo merecerlo". - Winston Churchill"

REFERENCE           THE_MILITARY_DONT_START
LANG_ENGLISH        ""The military don't start wars. Politicians start wars." - Gen. William Westmoreland"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Los militares no empiezan las guerras. Son los políticos los que las empiezan".  - General William C. Westmoreland"

REFERENCE           IF_YOU_KNOW_THE_ENEMY
LANG_ENGLISH        ""If you know the enemy and know yourself, you need not fear the result of a hundred battles." - Sun-Tzu"
LANG_SPANISH         ""Si conoces al enemigo y te conoces a ti mismo, no debes temer el resultado de un centenar de batallas". - Sun-Tzu"


